  "story": {
    "day": 60,
    "title": "Kaya's Lunch Break",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya felt hungry for lunch and opened her lunchbox.",
      "Inside, there was a radish sandwich and many candies.",
      "Her mother made it in the kitchen.",
      "Her friend, Lisa, sat under a big tree.",
      "Lisa spoke about her American grandfather now.",
      "He lived in California near the sea.",
      "\"What's for social studies?\" Lisa asked Kaya.",
      "Kaya thought about their Asia art project to try painting.",
      "\"Uh-huh,\" Kaya replied.",
      "\"Does your school have basketball?\" Lisa asked.",
      "Kaya took trumpet lessons for a festival party.",
      "She sent her regards to Lisa's grandfather."
    ]
  }
}